## Review Notes

- **Independent types:** The chunk types are new to this directory. They neither reuse nor pollute `ai-elements`' `AiSourceItem` — a retrieved chunk carries body text and a character count, which a URL citation does not.
- **Export naming:** The child exports only as `TxContextChunk`, with no unprefixed alias, so it cannot shadow the same-named `ContextChunk` data type at the package root.
- **Divergences from upstream:** hover feedback gated on `href`, late arrivals excluded from the stagger, and delays zeroed under reduced motion — all three correct upstream defects.
